    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7516" root="حر" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِيرَةٌ</span></b>  n. un. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِيرٌ</span> [q. v.]. (Msb.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also
<i>A kind of soup of flour and grease</i> or <i>gravy:</i>
(TA:) or <i>flour cooked with milk,</i> (S, K,) or <i>with
grease</i> or <i>gravy:</i> (K:) it is of flour, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَزِيرَةٌ</span>
is of bran: (Sh:) [when a mess of this kind is
thickest,] it is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصِيدَة</span>; then, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِيرَة</span>; then, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِيرَة</span>;
then, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَسْوٌ</span>. (IAar.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفِيتَةٌ</span>.]

